@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@seedEmail = user1@example.com
@seedPassword = password123

# Фаза 7, первая половина: POST оценки и GET среднего.
# PUT/DELETE /ratings/:id ещё нет.
# Seed: user1 уже оценил образец #1 — повторный POST на #1 даст 400.

### Login seed user1
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{seedEmail}}",
  "password": "{{seedPassword}}"
}

### Login seed user2
# @name loginUser2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@example.com",
  "password": "{{seedPassword}}"
}

### Create sample to rate (чтобы не упереться в seed-оценку user1 на #1)
# @name createSample
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rating demo",
  "type": "WATER",
  "country": "Germany"
}

### Average before any rating (ожидание 200, average_rating null, ratings_count 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/rating

### Add rating score 5 (ожидание 201)
# @name addRating
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5,
  "comment": "Sample suitable for analysis"
}

### Average after one rating (ожидание 5 и count 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/rating

### Same user rates again (ожидание 400 You have already rated this sample)
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 1
}

### user2 rates the same sample (ожидание 201) — среднее станет 4.5
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginUser2.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 4,
  "comment": "Good quality"
}

### Average after two ratings (ожидание 4.5 и count 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/rating

### Seed sample #1 average (ожидание 200, у seed уже есть оценки)
GET {{baseUrl}}/samples/1/rating

### Score 6 (ожидание 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 6
}

### Without token (ожидание 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples/{{createSample.response.body.id}}/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5
}

### Missing sample (ожидание 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/samples/999999/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5
}

### Average missing sample (ожидание 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/samples/999999/rating
